cretopass is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

This file lists all direct and transitive crate dependencies compiled into
the cretopass binary, along with their license identifiers (SPDX). All
dependencies are available under permissive licenses compatible with MIT.
Where a crate is offered under multiple licenses, the MIT (or otherwise most
permissive) option is selected for use in this project.

For the full license text of each crate, see its source repository or the
vendored copy under ~/.cargo/registry/src/ after building with Cargo.


